1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,980
Hi kids, I'm Qiqi.

2
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:12,260
Welcome back to Qiqi Meets the Little Prince~

3
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:20,780
Last time, Qiqi saw the drunkard's planet.

4
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:26,820
Drinking won't solve problems — facing them is braver!

5
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:34,460
Today, they come to a tiny planet with just one lamp and one person!

6
00:00:34,759 --> 00:00:39,539
The little prince and Qiqi kept flying, still on their way home.

7
00:00:39,839 --> 00:00:43,259
This time they came to a very very small planet.

8
00:00:43,559 --> 00:00:47,859
So small there was only one lamp post and one person.

9
00:00:48,159 --> 00:00:52,459
Qiqi and the little prince gently landed on the tiny planet.

10
00:00:52,759 --> 00:00:56,179
That person held a match in their hand.

11
00:00:56,479 --> 00:00:58,779
Snap! The lamp lit up.

12
00:00:59,079 --> 00:01:01,459
Snap! The lamp went out.

13
00:01:01,759 --> 00:01:04,699
Then it lit up again. And went out again.

14
00:01:04,999 --> 00:01:07,299
What are you doing?

15
00:01:07,599 --> 00:01:10,539
Qiqi asked curiously.

16
00:01:10,839 --> 00:01:12,259
I'm lighting the lamp.

17
00:01:12,559 --> 00:01:15,259
Why do you keep doing it?

18
00:01:15,559 --> 00:01:19,499
It's his job, like how daddy goes to work every day.

19
00:01:19,799 --> 00:01:24,019
But this planet was so small, it spun so very fast.

20
00:01:24,319 --> 00:01:29,259
Sigh... I just lit it, now I have to put it out again.

21
00:01:29,559 --> 00:01:31,539
The person wiped sweat.

22
00:01:31,839 --> 00:01:36,059
Then why don't you rest for a while?

23
00:01:36,359 --> 00:01:39,299
I can't. A job is a job.

24
00:01:39,599 --> 00:01:43,179
But you've been doing the right thing!

25
00:01:43,479 --> 00:01:48,979
Without you, this planet wouldn't have any light.

26
00:01:49,279 --> 00:01:52,139
The person stopped and looked at the lamp.

27
00:01:52,439 --> 00:01:56,259
The lamp went out, they lit it again.

28
00:01:56,559 --> 00:02:01,979
Persisting in doing the right thing, even when it's tiring, is really remarkable.

29
00:02:02,279 --> 00:02:07,299
I'll do one helpful thing every day from now on!

30
00:02:07,599 --> 00:02:14,299
The person kept lighting the lamp. Snap! Bright. Snap! Dark.

31
00:02:14,599 --> 00:02:18,339
But this tiny planet became so warm because of that lamp.

32
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:23,339
Kids, what helpful thing did you do today?

33
00:02:23,639 --> 00:02:28,339
Tell Qiqi in the comments~

34
00:02:28,639 --> 00:02:38,859
Next time, Qiqi and the little prince are going to meet a geographer!

35
00:02:39,159 --> 00:02:49,379
Good night, see you tomorrow~ ⭐

